    skos:definition "A business intelligence developer designs, builds and maintains BI solutions — data models, ETL/ELT processes, reports and interactive dashboards — using tools such as Power BI, Tableau, SSRS, SSIS and SQL, to deliver reporting and analytics to an organisation. Distinct from a BI analyst, the role focuses on building the BI systems."@en ;
