    skos:broader jobkb:OCC_26254ee56561 ;
    skos:definition "Boom operators set up and operate the boom microphone, either by hand, on an arm or on a moving platform. They make sure that every microphone is correctly stationed on set and in the best position to capture the dialogues. Boom operators are also responsible for the microphones on the actors clothing."@en ;
