jobkb:UOCC_8e7f80de121f a skos:Concept,
        jobkbo:Occupation ;
    skos:broader jobkb:OCC_438689ba7681 ;
    skos:definition "Design strategies for enterprise databases, data warehouse systems, and multidimensional networks. Set standards for database operations, programming, query processes, and security. Model, design, and construct large relational databases or data warehouses. Create and optimize data models for warehouse infrastructure and workflow. Integrate new systems with existing warehouse structure and refine system performance and functionality."@en ;
