    skos:definition "An MLOps engineer designs and operates the infrastructure, pipelines and tooling to deploy, serve, monitor, version and scale machine-learning models in production. The role combines machine learning, software engineering, DevOps and cloud practices to automate the machine-learning lifecycle (training, deployment, monitoring, retraining)."@en ;
