    skos:broader jobkb:OCC_e7f39b2bf662 ;
    skos:definition "An analytics engineer builds, tests and documents clean, reliable data models and analysis-ready datasets — typically with SQL and transformation tools such as dbt — transforming raw data warehouse data into curated tables that data analysts and business users consume. The role bridges data engineering and data analysis, applying software-engineering practices (version control, testing, CI/CD) to analytics."@en ;
